  <content>
  <section><para>Complete the following questions to practice the skills you have learned in this lesson.</para>
<section class="check-understanding"><exercise data-content-id="effa51f0-de35-4b1e-baca-468e423abcd4"><problem><para>
      <para>For questions 1 – 7, find the factored form of the quadratic expression.</para>
      <para>\(x^2+4x − 12\)</para>
      </para><para>Multiple Choice:</para><para>\((x − 2)(x − 6)\)</para><para>\((x + 3)(x − 4)\)</para><para>\((x + 2)(x − 6)\)</para><para>\((x − 2)(x + 6)\)</para></problem><solution><para>\((x − 2)(x + 6)\)</para><para>
      <para>The correct answer is \((x − 2)(x + 6)\).
      </para>
    </para></solution></exercise></section></section>
</content>
